Incompatibilites:
!!!
**Dollar Dragon Fix - Obsolete mod
Big Heist Improvements**
Already included in the mod, just in a different way.
!!!

Makes changes to the roguelite and multiplayer to improve the experience.
Playing with [No Boss Level](https://modworkshop.net/mod/54337) mod is recommended (as it is otherwise pointless without it).
Includes [No Roguelite Robots + Restored Cutscenes mod;](https://modworkshop.net/mod/54334), [Old Scudos](https://modworkshop.net/mod/51826), [Shock Trooper AI Fix](https://modworkshop.net/mod/55463), [Big Heist Improvements](https://modworkshop.net/mod/55497), [More Boss Skins](https://modworkshop.net/mod/54585), [Enemy Character Packs](https://modworkshop.net/mod/58340), [Improved Hielo Vintovka Skin](https://modworkshop.net/mod/58485), [Icon Fixes](https://modworkshop.net/mod/58589) and [Graves Captains](https://modworkshop.net/mod/57846) mods.

Changes (WIP, more to be added in the future):
!!!
Gangs and Police Tiers overhaul:
- Graves no longer have overpowered weapon setups;
- Touchdown has weaker weapons (especially on Tier 1);
- Scudos are no longer poorly armed and bulletsponges (they are now the opposite and also back to being Italian);
- Generic enemy captains are better armed;
- Shock Trooper melee swing cooldown is now dependent on police tier (AI Fix);
- Police Sniper damage is doubled;
- Shields are back to using the Swiss instead of the Glizzy (nearly double damage difference) with variants scaling based on police tier;
- Butchers have stronger, higher damage dealing saws and shorter cleaver throwing cooldowns;
- Shield SWATs have the same HP as regular SWAT but have stronger shield glass and do double melee damage;
- Sniper SWATs have the same HP as regular SWAT but hit chance scales up with tiers;
- Swapped melee weapons for Sicarios and Riders.

General:
- Only one enemy can be pinged/marked at a time and it only lasts for 5 seconds;
- Rebalanced equipment (Sentry takes 60 seconds longer to recharge and cannot be stacked with Geared, Flash Grenade no longer stuns through objects, Distraction Magazine is now a one time use item (but rechargeable with kills), Berserk and Adrenaline are now melee focused: no longer providing super fast reloads and increased gun damage while increasing damage reduction);
- Timm4 default magazine is now correct (20) and trades accuracy stats with the Sturm GWR;
- AAS shoots half pellets/does half damage but has increased ammo reserve;
- Disabled certain DLC perks from Roguelite generation (Cracker DLC, Chase DLC, Wiz DLC except Packed, and Ninja Smoke DLC except Rebound on Brutes);
- Bearslayer is no longer a straight upgrade to the 357 BOA (currently identical in stats) and they both do more damage;
- Practicals, SL8s and BU-RPs no longer deal shit damage in enemy hands;
- Shotguns no longer have penetration;
- Minor rebalances for some weapons (mostly total ammo related, WIP);
- Rebalanced characters (including Multiplayer Boss);
- Rebalanced melee weapons;
- Rebalanced and reworked perks (WIP, notable ones are Ghost merged with Dodge and Desperado replacing it);
- Restored Rebar melee weapon;
- Added two SL8 variants, two Urban Striker variants and an SPX variant (sights);
- Changed the opening cutscene of Juiced Up, Iced Out (also added to Money Train standalone plotline), as well as swapped Cracker for Tuna;
- Mercs no longer deal more melee damage than Brutes;
- Thieves and Assasins detection speed bonuses aren't as high as before (15 and 20% max reduction);
- Added the Annihilator revolver as a Primary weapon;
- Decreased difficulty of Armored Trucks heists so that they are doable at Heat 5;
- Loud variants of the regular bank heist no longer have scripted heat;
- Disabled alien content (alien rumble map is still playable but weapons are not usable);
- Changed music played on Golf With The Dragon and Great Escape ([Preview](https://youtu.be/DqnJnJ5TlXQ?si=3ctWK41Nzz9uzFr_&t=137));
- Scudo Robots now have pink lights;
- Added Money Train 2/Rendezvouz edit;
- Bodycount now always plays on the Chopper escape variant of the Bank job;
- Tuna gets a unique Practical variant;
- Added unused 99p music to Free Graves and Cyberstorm (latter only applies to robot ambush finale).

Roguelite:
- Gold Cup and Last Verse can no longer be the 1st plotline;
- Runaway, Jupiter, Vamp, Stinger and Ropes don't have reduced job cuts anymore;
- Legendary tier characters start with 1 perk like everyone else instead of 2;
- DLC characters no longer have priority over other characters;
- Generic characters only come pre-leveled (Level 2 max) upon reaching Affiliated respect level;
- Reduced prices of Uncommon and Rare generic characters;
- Increased prices of Epic and (especially) Legendary equipment (no more cheap Sentries);
- Purchasing ziplines for Dragon Dogs is now required and are no longer marked;
- Successfully completing the Dragon Dogs plotline now shows extra cutscenes (unless Khan is gone);
- Whether you get the Ringer or Cash Trucks variant of the Money Train plotline depends on whether or not it is your 1st plotline of the campaign;
- Classic Roguelite is an additional option, on which The Last Verse and Hans Fang plotlines do not trigger (neither does the Cold Strike or Auction House event). Gold Cup and Cagnali's Order are up to the player to enable/disable via Steam DLC system;
- Roguelite Normal & Hard difficulties use gameplay values from Extreme difficulty while other aspects remain the same (character missions unaffected);
- Wiz plotline plays extra cutscenes;
- Gang robbery missions can now also involve the Scudos;
- Changed intro cutscenes;
- Scorp Elites with Volk's skin will no longer appear in the shop (instead, unskinned ones will);
- You no longer start the game with Baker's Bearslayer (have to buy it similarly to the Repeater);
- Increased investigation per day on lower difficulties (13 and 15% for Normal and Hard);
- Amount of detectives per run and chances of appearing are now the same across all difficulties;
- Bribe The Cops and Interfere With Investigation goals now freeze investigation for 2 days instead of decreasing it;
- Characters take longer to max level (+1 mission);
- Increased difficulty of the Art Gallery and Night Bank job when going loud;
- Fixed Tier 3 Army Upgrade playing the wrong cutscene for the Compound and High Security Warehouse;
- Fixed Rescue Khan's dealer job appearing even if Hielo was gone;
- Hielo can now do heists if failed or ignored by the player (WIP);
- Added effects for rejecting Last Verse and failing Dragon Dogs;
- DLC character variants no longer show up in the Roguelite by default (download the new Submod to re-enable them as well as enable the ones from the mod and Matt DLC, disables Gold Cup adding Janitor to the hiring pool);
- Changed investigation goals to trigger more reliably (as it was sometimes possible to never get the 2nd goal before reaching 100% investigation even without wasting days).

Multiplayer:
- Multiplayer difficulties all use Extreme difficulty values, and now instead change starting heat (3/4/5) and enemy tiers (2/3/3);
- New team members (Casey, Gloves, Nasara, Monarch Baker, Savant Nasara, Werevolk, Mighty Mother, Vixen Vamp, Mac, Carlos, Luna, Khan and dlc-less versions of Hielo and Dollar Dragon) and boss skins;
- Reworked Urban Legends;
- Changed Shuffle lists (Big heists show up at the end of Short shuffles; Cold Strike is not part of it);
- Moved the ending cutscene of New Blood to the beginning of the Urban Legend;
- Added original version of Mozart's rifle (used in Urban Legend);
- Removed scripted heat on Golf With The Dragon;
- Copied Mac's stats over to Mozart (Urban Legend rescue mission).

Big Heist Improvements differences:
- Import Export detectives timer is 6 minutes, and shrinks by 30 seconds for every extra player;
- Hidden Vault and Dragon Dogs start at Heat 4 in Roguelite (difficulty dependent in Multiplayer);
- Heat no longer increases on vault open (Dragon Dogs Heat increases when the dogs are secured);
- Gold Cup stealth timer is 8 minutes in Roguelite, and 6 minutes in Multiplayer.
!!!

Notes:
- Due to the amount of changes and additions, it is not recommended to host public lobbies (although surprisingly it is still playable);
- If a boss slot has Ghost or Dodge/Desperado equipped, it has to be re-equipped whenever the mod is added or removed or they will not work (indicated by an empty perk slot on the character wheel);
- Make sure Dollar Dragon Alternate Appearance is Off for the correct outfit during Golf With The Dragon (reverse for when mod isn't active).

Plotline tweaks (somewhat outdated) available as standalone (Dragon Dogs, Money Train, Wiz Missions)
